UnstuffMyBags is presented by: Great House Telvanni, EU
======

Provides a keybinding to destroy all crap items. This includes common style 
items for motifs 1-10 (you can buy them at the vendor's anyway) as well as white 
gear picked up from tables etc. that's not worth anything.
Also contains a noob-friendly documentation, so everyone can tweak it on 
their own.

The addons I used to learn from were Thenedus's Junkee and Garkin's Dustman.

Installation and Setup
----------------------

- Copy complete folder to
  %USERPROFILE%\Documents\Elder Scrolls Online\<megaserver>\AddOns
  where <megaserver> is "live" for North America and "liveeu" for Europe
  (or use Minion)
- Bind a key to "Delete all bag detritus"
- Bind a key do "Junk all bag detritus"

Use while bags are open

